<title>POLAND: PPABANK AUG NET RISES TO PLN 1.0 MLN.</title>
<headline>PPABANK AUG NET RISES TO PLN 1.0 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results August</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit					  0.95 vs    0.28</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    1.57 vs    0.75</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		  3.64 vs    2.35</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	 4.96 vs    3.01</p>
<p>JANUARY-AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit					  5.21 vs    2.24</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    9.18 vs    4.40</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 25.80 vs   14.48</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	33.80 vs   21.00</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Pierwszy</p>
<p>Polsko-Amerykaoski Bank SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
